OL,3,GNEWSASafety defects found in Tyne
OL,4,APedestrian Tunnel
OL,5,
OL,6,FSignificant "safety and operational
OL,7,Fdefects" have been discovered at the
OL,8,FTyne Pedestrian and Cyclist Tunnels.
OL,10,FThe two vertical lifts at the
OL,11,Funderwater crossing have been taken out
OL,12,Fof service for urgent repair works.
OL,14,FIt is the latest serious maintenance
OL,15,Fissue at the Grade II-listed tunnels,
OL,16,Ffollowing a heavily-delayed and
OL,17,Fover-budget renovation which eventually
OL,18,Fconcluded in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
