OL,3,GNEWSASafety defects found in Tyne
OL,4,APedestrian Tunnel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the North East
OL,7,Fmayoral authority said: "A recent
OL,8,Fsurvey of the vertical lifts identified
OL,9,Fseveral issues requiring repair and, as
OL,10,Fa result, the lifts were withdrawn from
OL,11,Fservice while the necessary works are
OL,12,Fcarried out."
